 Money is `Decimal` dollars, rounded to cents half-up (`shop/money.py`).
 Shipping is a flat $7.95, free once the merchandise subtotal reaches $75.
 Sales tax is 8.25% of merchandise only; shipping is not taxed.
+
+Discount codes (`shop/discounts.py`), one at a time, case-insensitive:
+
+- `SAVE10`: 10% off the merchandise subtotal, rounded to cents half-up.
+- `FIVEOFF`: $5.00 off.
+- A discount never exceeds the subtotal.
+- Applying a valid code replaces the current one. An unknown code raises
+  `InvalidCode` (a `ValueError`) and leaves the current code in place.
+- Tax is charged on the subtotal after the discount.
+- The free-shipping threshold uses the subtotal before the discount.
+- The receipt shows `Discount (CODE)` as a negative amount, such as `-$4.33`,
+  between Subtotal and Shipping, only when a code is applied.
